<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_877_2485.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundtlich</unclear> willig diennst zuvor ehrnvest
<lb n="2"/>ersam unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weysß</unclear>, besonder lieb unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gutte</unclear>
<lb n="3"/>freundt, es hat unns unnsers mitburgers <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sohne</unclear>
<lb n="4"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hanns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Danner</unclear></persName> messerschmidt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuerkennen</unclear> geben,
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachdem</unclear> er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verschiner</unclear> zeit sich zu <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Alltkirch</unclear>
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bei</unclear></placeName> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-133" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Bassel</unclear></placeName>, als er <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hanndtwerckh</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nachgezogen</unclear>
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ehelichen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verheiratt</unclear>, unnd also biß in das <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">funffte</unclear>
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jhar</unclear> das messerschmidt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hanndtwerckh</unclear>, wie <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ein</unclear>
<lb n="9"/>ehrlich maister <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gebrauch</unclear>, auch sich in angeregter
<lb n="10"/>zeit, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ufhrecht</unclear> unnd redlich, unnd wie ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jeder</unclear>
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">burger</unclear> gegen seiner <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">oberkheit</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuthun</unclear> schuldig, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gehallten</unclear>
<lb n="12"/>dieweil aber sein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gelegenheit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lennger</unclear> alda zu
<lb n="13"/>bleiben nit sein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">weill</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">derhalben</unclear> von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemelt</unclear>
<lb n="14"/>seiner <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">oberkheit</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gutten</unclear> abschid unnd mit der-
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">selben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gutten</unclear> gunst <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erlaubnuß</unclear> genomen,
<lb n="16"/>wie er dann dessen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glaubwurdig</unclear> urkhundt uff-
<lb n="17"/>zulegen hat, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">veil</unclear> mer an anndern <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ortten</unclear>,
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">innsonnderheit</unclear> aber in E. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">F</unclear>. E. W. statt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zu</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sanck</unclear>
<lb n="19"/>Gallen</placeName> seiner <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">besseren</unclear> narung halber, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zubegeben</unclear>
<lb n="20"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">niderzulassen</unclear> willens unnd vorhabens,
<lb n="21"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">derhalben</unclear> unns umb unnser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">furschrifft</unclear> an
<lb n="22"/>E. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">F</unclear>. E. W. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mitzuthailen</unclear> ( <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deren</unclear> er nit wenig
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zugeniessen</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihme</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zu</unclear> erlangung seines <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">furnem</unclear>-
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ens</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dienstlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zu</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> kainen zweiffel stellet ) <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diemiettig</unclear> an-
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geruffen</unclear> unnd gebetten, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">welches</unclear> wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihme</unclear>, als
<lb n="26"/>unnserm burgers sohn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abzuschlagen</unclear> nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewisst</unclear>
